# Auth & Database Rules

## Paths

| Concern | Location |
| --- | --- |
| DB schema | `src/db/schema/` |
| Auth service | `src/auth/service.ts` |
| Session cookies | `src/auth/session.ts` |
| Server RPC | `src/lib/auth/functions.ts` |
| Zod schemas | `src/lib/auth/schemas.ts` |

## Server functions

```typescript
// ✅ Mutations and private reads
export const myFn = createServerFn({ method: "POST" })
  .validator(zodSchema)
  .middleware([requireAuthMiddleware])
  .handler(async ({ data, context }) => { ... });
```

## Security

- scrypt passwords; timing-safe login
- Password reset: same response whether email exists
- Session rotation on login and password change
- Never store session tokens in localStorage

## Roles

Public signup: `user`, `trainer`, `club`. Staff: `admin`, `superadmin` via seed only.

Update `docs/TECH_SPEC.md` §4 and `docs/ACCOUNT_MODEL.md` when changing auth model.
